␀␀␀␀  scan [secs|-] [chans] - arm a capture (chans: "1,6,11" or "auto"); secs "-"␀␀␀                          (or omitted) = run until "stop"␀␀␀  chan <chans|auto>     - set channel hop set without arming; e.g. "6" or "6,36";␀␀␀                          named channels auto-select band(s) (overrides "band")␀  band <24|5|both>      - which radio band(s) to scan (dual-band board)␀  type <list|all|mgmt>  - frame kinds to keep (beacon,probe,assoc,deauth,auth,data,qos)␀  data [on|off]         - capture DATA frames too, to pair already-associated␀␀␀                          stations that send no fresh assoc frame (nets needs this)␀  clients [chan]        - shortcut: lock chan (or the current one), no beacons,␀                          data on, arm indefinite -- the usual "who's on my net" scan␀␀␀  watch [on|off]        - live decoded frame dump while capturing␀␀␀  nets                  - condensed AP + associated-station view␀␀␀␀  list                  - one line per known WiFi record␀␀␀␀  status | stop | clear | help␀␀  caps                  - machine-readable "CAPS a,b,c" list of commands this build has␀  factory yes             - wipe NVS settings + reboot␀␀  send help             - Send Frame injection commands␀  localap help          - Local AP / captive portal commands␀␀␀␀  sentinel help         - Deauth/Karma/Rogue watch commands␀ERR unknown command "%s" (try: help)
