Д␀ДKB$o(␀ДKB0®¤␀ДKB|ЯЎ␀ДKB„ул␀ДKB vN␀ДKBґж-␀ДKBДO3␀ДKBм”Л␀ДKBё'л␀РKBЬ¦2␀РKBд_␀РKB␀␀аKBМ ␀аKBPЗї␀аKB¤+°␀аKBА%й␀аKB␀l␀иKB е*␀иKB,03␀иKB @ ␀иKBА?␀иKB␀9␀рKB␀p␀␀LB␀"k␀␀LBXmЏ␀LBht␀␀LB␀Ж␀LBЦM␀LB~е␀LBИУЈ␀LBћ␀LB‡,␀LB,VЬ␀LB¬ћ␀LB␀m␀ LB$¤<␀ LBDЩз␀ LBtѓВ␀ LBґыд␀4LBМ-а␀4LB␀$l␀@LBlу␀PLB”ґ␀PLB␀ж␀hLBАЕ ␀hLB␀*␀xLB␀%ћ␀xLBHЫP␀xLBш=я␀xLB␀w␀ЂLB␀!j␀ЂLB<©ф␀ЂLB¤4Щ␀ЂLB␀␀€LB␀ђL␀”LB␀аL␀ЁLBRT␀␀°LB␀␀ИLBЊэр␀ИLB␀Ћ␀ЬLBbд␀рLB␀F␀јJB␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀в(Bт(Bф-B␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀В3B␀4B‚5BшMB␀NBNBNBNB,NB@NBPNB\NBlNB|NB€NB”NB¤NB°NB␀␀␀␀␀␀␀яяяяяя␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀St9exception␀␀␀␀ьUB,йBSt9bad_alloc␀␀␀␀WBDйB<йB␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀ІABаAB>^B␀␀␀␀␀␀zD␀␀pA␀␀@A␀␀ЂA␀␀°Aяяяяяя␀␀framesdrain␀ФaBдaBрaBbB$bB8bBDbBTbB␀␀␀␀␀␀яяя␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀P␀␀Ђ␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>802Eleven</title>
<link rel="icon" href="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%2064%2064'%3E%3Crect%20width='64'%20height='64'%20rx='14'%20fill='%230f1420'/%3E%3Ctext%20x='32'%20y='40'%20font-family='Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif'%20font-size='24'%20font-weight='700'%20text-anchor='middle'%20fill='%234da3ff'%3E802%3C/text%3E%3Cpath%20d='M44%2016a16%2016%200%200%201%2012%205'%20stroke='%2337d67a'%20stroke-width='3'%20fill='none'%20stroke-linecap='round'/%3E%3Cpath%20d='M47%2020a10%2010%200%200%201%207%203'%20stroke='%2337d67a'%20stroke-width='3'%20fill='none'%20stroke-linecap='round'%20opacity='.85'/%3E%3Ccircle%20cx='51'%20cy='25'%20r='2.5'%20fill='%2337d67a'/%3E%3C/svg%3E">


